1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,155
You rub your eyes

2
00:00:01,155 --> 00:00:02,302
and the darkness

3
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:02,982
fills with

4
00:00:02,982 --> 00:00:04,070
stars.

5
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:04,760
Relax,

6
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,020
no light got in,

7
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:06,600
your eyeball

8
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,832
just pocket-dialed

9
00:00:07,832 --> 00:00:09,150
your brain.

10
00:00:09,345 --> 00:00:10,360
The back of your eye

11
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,460
is lined with

12
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,760
light sensors

13
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,460
that know

14
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,630
one word:

15
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:15,700
LIGHT!

16
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,768
Rub your eye,

17
00:00:16,768 --> 00:00:18,056
they get squished...

18
00:00:18,056 --> 00:00:18,913
and they shout it

19
00:00:18,913 --> 00:00:19,933
anyway.

20
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:20,472
Your brain

21
00:00:20,472 --> 00:00:21,530
can't check,

22
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:22,332
so it paints you

23
00:00:22,332 --> 00:00:23,780
fireworks.

24
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:24,740
Isaac Newton

25
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:25,800
tested this

26
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,740
by sliding a needle

27
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,787
behind his own

28
00:00:27,787 --> 00:00:29,000
eyeball...

29
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:29,463
and saw

30
00:00:29,463 --> 00:00:31,150
colored rings.

31
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:31,944
Do not

32
00:00:31,944 --> 00:00:33,100
do that.

33
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:33,874
Astronauts

34
00:00:33,874 --> 00:00:34,796
see flashes like this

35
00:00:34,796 --> 00:00:36,020
with their eyes shut...

36
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:36,420
probably

37
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,630
cosmic rays,

38
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:38,131
zipping through

39
00:00:38,131 --> 00:00:38,864
their eyeballs

40
00:00:38,864 --> 00:00:39,304
and making

41
00:00:39,304 --> 00:00:40,840
the same call.

42
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,553
So rub gently...

43
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:43,193
that phone

44
00:00:43,193 --> 00:00:43,753
never gets

45
00:00:43,753 --> 00:00:45,076
an upgrade.

